[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16321.59, "timestamp": "04:32:01", "text": "当然可以，哥们儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16323.11, "timestamp": "04:32:03", "text": "当人们处于单身状态时，他们就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16324.55, "timestamp": "04:32:04", "text": "比如，“哦，我的意思是，当人们……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16326.309, "timestamp": "04:32:06", "text": "单身人士会说：“哦，我想要个女朋友。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16327.59, "timestamp": "04:32:07", "text": "或者诸如此类的事情。但当他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16329.269, "timestamp": "04:32:09", "text": "收到 GIF 时，他们会说：“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16336.389, "timestamp": "04:32:16", "text": "不，我对现在拥有的很满意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16341.83, "timestamp": "04:32:21", "text": "挺好的。哦，真为你高兴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16345.51, "timestamp": "04:32:25", "text": "对你有好处。哦不，我要死了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16348.389, "timestamp": "04:32:28", "text": "饥饿。不，等等。哦，不。最混蛋"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16352.149, "timestamp": "04:32:32", "text": "你可以说：“希望它能长久。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16354.469, "timestamp": "04:32:34", "text": "希望它能一直持续下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16358.07, "timestamp": "04:32:38", "text": "真为你高兴，兄弟。对你有好处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16359.67, "timestamp": "04:32:39", "text": "为什么这些黄金都散落在地上？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16362.469, "timestamp": "04:32:42", "text": "大约？这到底是什么怪事？可能就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16365.75, "timestamp": "04:32:45", "text": "某处的墓地。这是一座矿井。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16367.75, "timestamp": "04:32:47", "text": "那里有一群蜘蛛。等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16370.63, "timestamp": "04:32:50", "text": "我的健康状况正在恶化，下降了25%。我的天啊。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16373.51, "timestamp": "04:32:53", "text": "不。不，不，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16374.71, "timestamp": "04:32:54", "text": "很多这样的东西。我真的好嘿，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16376.55, "timestamp": "04:32:56", "text": "那里有一块墓碑。我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16377.83, "timestamp": "04:32:57", "text": "我没有铲子。我入土了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16379.99, "timestamp": "04:32:59", "text": "抢。"}]